OL,3,ANavi Pillay, former UN human rights
OL,4,Acommissioner, wins Nobel Peace Prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Nobel Peace Prize 2026 is awarded
OL,7,Fto Navi Pillay - watch live coverage
OL,8,Fabove
OL,10,FPillay, a former UN human rights
OL,11,Fcommissioner, is recognised for her
OL,12,F"efforts to promote peace and
OL,13,Finternational law", the Norwegian Nobel
OL,14,FCommittee says
OL,16,FIt's the 126th year of the prestigious
OL,17,Fprize - 287 candidates were nominated,
OL,18,Fincluding 208 individuals and 79
OL,19,Forganisations
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
